ps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107596.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107596.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-18T17:50:28Z"},"body":"Closes #90957\nSupersedes #91077 by allowing instead of denying.\r\n\r\n\r\n`AudioStreamWAV` offset, loop begin and loop end have been changed to use `int64_t` instead of `int`. WAV files store the sample count using 32-bit, so it's virtually impossible for it to overflow. A cast from `uint32_t` to `int64_t` should be safe.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, every `Vector::resize()` call has been placed inside error macros.\n\nThis is very unlikely to happen as not everyone uses WAV files over 2GB, but doesn't hurt to fix anyway.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107596/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107596/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}